# RepoWise indexing exclusions (added for Claude Code context-tooling evaluation).
# Belt-and-suspenders on top of the existing .gitignore, which already covers
# node_modules, .next/, /build, .vercel, and .env*.

.env*
**/secrets/
**/secret/
**/credentials/
**/credential/
**/*keychain*
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.next/
.vercel/

# Duplicate Claude Code git-worktree checkouts (generated/parallel branches,
# one observed to contain a stray .env.local already caught by the .env*
# rule above). Not primary source; exclude the whole tree defensively.
.claude/worktrees/
